{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119728","id":3739645218,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7e5nUi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119728","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119728.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119728.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119728","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119728/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119728/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119728/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f797c0bda2f227499c8026cd0c2d3b913633254a","number":119728,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add ability to order alphabetically in Profiler","user":{"login":"boycher","id":274249743,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFi4Dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274249743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher","html_url":"https://github.com/boycher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14810\r\n\r\nCurrently, the functions in the profiler moves up and down based on their duration which causes them to move up and down rapidly and we don't success to click on the function we want.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a `Sort:` option in the profiler which allows us to set the order of functions. It includes three sort options `Duration`, `Name (Ascending)` and `Name (Descending)`. By default, this option is set to the `Duration`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f10c1360-7273-40f7-be00-42013474f9e1\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThe Sort dropdown is placed in the profiler toolbar along with the existing Measure and Time dropdowns, following the same OptionButton pattern already used there.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godo